`implementation-plan.md` must decide files, hooks, stores, state placement, flows, UI/Figma mapping, and tests. `build-checklist.md` must verify those decisions. `questions.md` is for handoff questions only.

## Ngôn ngữ output

Viết bằng tiếng Việt có dấu đầy đủ (theo `.frontend-delivery/rules/vietnamese-output.md`). Giữ nguyên code/path/command/API field/DTO/error code/route/package/SRS section.

